{"version":1,"content":"<p>楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明及陳展鵬，3位視帝及2位視后主演的無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》下周一（9日）首播。</p><p>劇集以娛樂圈為背景，透過一宗相隔7年仍疑點重重的死亡事件，揭開名利背後的慾望與人性角力。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:44.337972+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:19:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:38:23.334555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.883665+00:00","content_hash":"b69b596db4ab26bf75d536a4f8ad5d802e284d34201d2c1a34d19315c5d96474","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}